    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Take on the challenge and dive into amazing world of platformer game Butterfly Learn To Fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every jump brings you closer to a magical transformation\u2014from a simple caterpillar into a graceful butterfly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0But be careful on your way: one wrong move - and you will fall, and part of the path will have to pass again.  The stakes are high - be precise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819820/extras/c82dde5a6678fbc6e1271a06ae1c7cd9.poster.avif?t=1754491770\" width=582 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819820/extras/c82dde5a6678fbc6e1271a06ae1c7cd9.webm?t=1754491770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819820/extras/c82dde5a6678fbc6e1271a06ae1c7cd9.mp4?t=1754491770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There is only one way - up, and you have only one enemy - your awkwardness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use rotating objects and platforms going up and down to get to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The deeper you dive, the more water is pushed out. Use it, but don't drown! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use your weight wherever possible and run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You will have helpers along the way and you will quickly realize who they are. They will never let you down and will always lift you up.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Take on the challenge and dive into amazing world of platformer game Butterfly Learn To Fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every jump brings you closer to a magical transformation\u2014from a simple caterpillar into a graceful butterfly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0But be careful on your way: one wrong move - and you will fall, and part of the path will have to pass again.  The stakes are high - be precise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819820/extras/c82dde5a6678fbc6e1271a06ae1c7cd9.poster.avif?t=1754491770\" width=582 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819820/extras/c82dde5a6678fbc6e1271a06ae1c7cd9.webm?t=1754491770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819820/extras/c82dde5a6678fbc6e1271a06ae1c7cd9.mp4?t=1754491770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There is only one way - up, and you have only one enemy - your awkwardness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use rotating objects and platforms going up and down to get to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The deeper you dive, the more water is pushed out. Use it, but don't drown! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use your weight wherever possible and run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You will have helpers along the way and you will quickly realize who they are. They will never let you down and will always lift you up.</p>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the world of the platformer game Butterfly, Learn To Fly! Each jump brings you closer to the magical transformation from a simple caterpillar to a graceful butterfly. But be careful on your way: one wrong move - and you will fall, and part of the path will have to pass again!",
